[[File:E 064.png|thumb|[[Red Cyclone|Red Cyclone]]]]
A '''Cyclone''' (サイクロン ''Saikuron'') is a form of [[Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]] resembling a whirlwind with a literal "eye of the storm". Cyclones are characterized by very high DPS and non-stop attacks with minimal backswing, which means they are nearly impossible to stall using meatshields alone. However, Cyclones also tend to have very low speed (with the exceptions of [[Primeval Cyclone]] and the Mini Cyclones) and range (with a couple of exceptions), which makes them highly vulnerable to cats with [[:Category:Cats with Freeze ability|Freeze]], [[:Category:Cats with Slow ability|Slow]], or [[:Category:Cats with Knockback ability|Knockback]] abilities.

While the [[Mysterious Calamity]] is easily mistaken for a Cyclone by design, it exhibits different behavior and is not considered as one.

==Major Cyclones==
'''Major Cyclones''' or '''full-sized Cyclones''' are predominantly found in their own [[Special Events|Event Stages]], called [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]], from which the player can unlock [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal Cats]]. They're generally the main threat of every stage they appear in, and will usually be supported by enemies of their respective traits. In [[Legend Stages|Zero Legends]], they appear as regular enemies.

The first Cyclone released was [[Red Cyclone]], which appears in [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Crimson Catastrophe]] and [[Crimson Vengeance]]. It's one of the strongest Cyclones in terms of stats, but also one of the easiest to counter because of its dual [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] traits. Other major Cyclones are:
