==Mini Cyclones==
'''Mini Cyclones''' (ミニサイクロン ''Mini Saikuron'') are common enemies without their own stages, instead appearing in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], [[Uncanny Legends]] and Zero Legends. Though they're significantly weaker than their larger variants, they're typically used as strong peons spawned multiple times throughout a [[battle]].

