==Existence Elsewhere==
Cyclones have made appearances in two of [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' other games, but as allied characters rather than enemies.
===[[Mr.Ninja!! Fever Collaboration Event|Mr.Ninja!! Fever]]===
In Mr.Ninja Fever, a Cyclone was a Super Rare Familiar obtainable via the gacha system.

===[[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou]]===
In YuruGeGe, an obtainable [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare unit]] was [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%a4%d2%a4%c8%a4%c4%a4%e1%a4%aa%bc%ea%b6%cc Hitotsume Otedama], which consisted of [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Hitotsume-Kozō|Hitotsume-Kozō]] holding [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Medama-Oyaji|Medama-Oyaji]] and [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Kemedama|Kemedama]]. Their Evolved Form, Hitotsume-go-Round, added [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Ichimokuren|Ichimokuren]], while their [[True Form]] was the Omega Cyclone, which had all three members of the Normal Form caught in its vortex. In terms of abilities, Omega Cyclone was strong against Amaterasu enemies, had a 40% chance to stop Amaterasu for 2 seconds, and was immune to weaken and freeze.
