==Trivia==
*The Cyclones' Japanese names consist entirely of English words written in katakana.
*There is a Cyclone for every standard type of enemy except [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], though [[White Cyclone]] was Traitless/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] until [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].
*The Cyclones, [[Doge]] and [[Gory]] are the only enemies to have both [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred]] and [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variants.
*[[The Perfect Cyclone]], [[Aku Cyclone]] and [[Primeval Cyclone]] have slower attack rates than the other Cyclones, by 1 frame.
**All Cyclones except for these three are tied for the fastest attack rate in the game.
*[[Red Cyclone]], [[Divine Cyclone]], [[Zyclone]], [[Cosmic Cyclone]] and Primeval Cyclone have the highest DPS of all enemies from their respective traits.
**Red Cyclone is second only to [[Teacher Cybear]] for the highest DPS of all enemies.
*All Mini Cyclones are implied or confirmed to be related to their bigger counterparts.
**[[Mesocosmocyclone]] is implied to be [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]]'s secret lovechild, especially in [[BCJP]].
**[[Li'l Zyclone]] is Zyclone's nephew.
**[[Mini White Cyclone]] is White Cyclone's little brother in [[BCEN]] and White Cyclone's second son in BCJP.
**[[Mini Angel Cyclone]] is stated to be Divine Cyclone's daughter in BCJP.
**[[E-792]] is implied to be The Perfect Cyclone's niece in BCJP.
*Mini White Cyclone is the only Cyclone to have Single Attack.
*Mini Angel Cyclone and E-792 are the only Cyclones who are confirmed to be female.
*Ironically, Mini White Cyclone and Mini Angel Cyclone have longer range than their bigger counterparts.

